<<<
The italic combinations ch, sh, zh, th, dh, ng, ngg, kw, represent the italicized parts of witch, wish, vision, pith, with, singer, finger, whit: thus, wich, wish, vizhon, pith, widh, singer, fingger, hwit.
===
The italic combinations *ch, sh, zh, th, dh, ng, ngg, hw*, represent the italicized parts of wi*tch*, wi*sh*, vi*si*on, pi*th*, wi*th*, si*ng*er, fi*ng*er, *wh*it: thus, wĭ*ch*, wĭ*sh*, vĭ*zh*on, pĭ*th*, wĭ*dh*, sĭ*ng*er, fĭ*ngg*er, *hw*ĭt.
>>>

